  unitName: Liquid Barrage Sheena
  unitId: 820958
  unitNumber: 8647
  description: "Although Sheena had succeeded thanks to the advice of the Fighting
    Nun, things turned for the worse when the gang of bandits demanded she traded
    her relic gun for the life of a boy who had been taken hostage while attempting
    to protect his home\u2014the sanctuary. Unexpectedly, however, the kidnapped
    boy caused a distraction that gave Sheena the upper hand once again, allowing
    the Sheriff, the Fighting Nun, and the hopeful locals to aid her in the fight
    against the bandits. After rising victorious against the villains, the leader
    of the gang of bandits challenged Sheena to one last duel. Once the two relic
    gun wielders faced each other off, only the righteous one would remain standing.
    Sheena began wielding both relic guns thereafter, leaving many to wonder exactly
    who she was."
  summonDesc: As long as evil exists, my journey's not over. <br>I'll go wherever
    my help is needed, that's the path I've chosen.
  fusionDesc: I understand now...<br>This relic gun wants to be used for good things,
    and I'm not about to let it down!
  evoDesc: I will follow my own sense of justice from now on. <br>What about you?
    What's justice in your eyes?
  element: 2
  rarity: 7
